                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is very imperfect with several major design flaws, a few minor issues with the spelling/grammar/word choice, and maybe one or two uncommon bugs. I loved it anyway. My gripes are about the nonsensical route logic...and yeah...the (alleged) [spoiler]incest[/spoiler]... The graphics are sometimes ugly, especially a certain Bratz Doll character whom I love anyway. There's not enough emotion in the reactions, and too many frames are static for the impact of the dialogue. The plot is problematic for several self-evident reasons, especially with the issue of [spoiler]the townsfolk hating the princess[/spoiler], but overall, the story is engrossing. I love it despite the dev's missteps.",
